          "id": "r3-dddeb1eca8704c4129a5118c5d27eb69",
          "index": 0,
          "issue": "An exception from stream.aclose() in the finally block replaces an earlier typed turn failure, such as INVALID_FINAL_MESSAGE or LIMIT_EXCEEDED. Bridge.call then reports generic SDK_FAILURE and loses the primary cause and cleanup classification.",
          "location": "gauntlet-review/python/gauntlet_review/codex_bridge/sdk.py:102",
