          "round": 3,
          "severity": "important",
          "suggestion": "Capture stream-close failure separately, preserve and chain the primary BridgeError, and report cleanup failure through the structured outcome without exposing partial text."
        }
      }
    ],
    "requested_verdict": "request_changes",
    "reviewer": "codex_reviewer",
    "summary": "Request changes. Two prior important findings remain open: coverage attests the snapshot digest instead of a distinct manifest digest, and finding IDs omit the review namespace. Typed store cleanup and cancelled native custody are addressed. A new SDK stream-close path can mask typed turn errors."
  },
